419
00:15:04,799 --> 00:15:06,297
But here is the twist.

420
00:15:06,477 --> 00:15:08,757
While the electric truck faded,

421
00:15:08,757 --> 00:15:10,227
the hybrid exploded.

422
00:15:10,407 --> 00:15:11,680
According to Ford,

423
00:15:11,680 --> 00:15:13,730
it sold eighty-four thousand,

424
00:15:13,730 --> 00:15:17,549
nine hundred thirty-four F-one-fifty hybrids in twenty

425
00:15:17,549 --> 00:15:19,811
twenty-five, up fifteen percent.

426
00:15:19,991 --> 00:15:23,791
The small Maverick hybrid sold eighty-one thousand

427
00:15:23,791 --> 00:15:25,007
and thirty-four.

428
00:15:25,187 --> 00:15:28,285
In total, Ford sold two hundred twenty-eight

429
00:15:28,285 --> 00:15:31,595
thousand hybrid vehicles in twenty twenty-five.

430
00:15:31,775 --> 00:15:32,985
The future arrived,

431
00:15:32,985 --> 00:15:35,212
just not in the form Ford expected.

432
00:15:35,561 --> 00:15:38,756
This tells you something important about truck

433
00:15:38,756 --> 00:15:39,242
