434
00:15:39,422 --> 00:15:41,237
They are willing to change,

435
00:15:41,237 --> 00:15:41,976
but slowly.

436
00:15:42,156 --> 00:15:44,374
A hybrid feels familiar.

437
00:15:44,554 --> 00:15:46,708
It fills up at a gas station,

438
00:15:46,708 --> 00:15:48,564
tows like a normal truck,

439
00:15:48,564 --> 00:15:50,718
and still saves fuel in town.

440
00:15:50,898 --> 00:15:53,757
Ford's own numbers show that American truck

441
00:15:53,757 --> 00:15:56,350
buyers chose the step that felt safest,

442
00:15:56,350 --> 00:15:57,214
not the leap.

443
00:15:57,564 --> 00:15:59,654
And the Lightning name is not dead.

444
00:15:59,834 --> 00:16:02,037
Ford has said it plans to bring

445
00:16:02,037 --> 00:16:05,163
it back as an extended-range electric truck,

446
00:16:05,163 --> 00:16:07,579
with a gas engine that charges the

447
00:16:07,579 --> 00:16:08,147
battery.

448
00:16:08,327 --> 00:16:10,720
So the name has now lived three

449
00:16:10,720 --> 00:16:11,183
lives.

450
00:16:11,363 --> 00:16:13,417
A supercharged hot rod,

451
00:16:13,417 --> 00:16:15,649
a battery-electric truck,

452
00:16:15,649 --> 00:16:18,596
and soon, a hybrid of both ideas.

453
00:16:18,946 --> 00:16:20,929
Now back to the race we mentioned

454
00:16:20,929 --> 00:16:21,710
at the start.

455
00:16:21,890 --> 00:16:24,916
In the third quarter of twenty twenty-six,

456
00:16:24,916 --> 00:16:26,861
according to autoevolution,

457
00:16:26,861 --> 00:16:29,887
Ford delivered two hundred three thousand,

458
00:16:29,887 --> 00:16:32,481
seven hundred seven F-Series trucks,

459
00:16:32,481 --> 00:16:34,498
down one point nine percent.

460
00:16:34,678 --> 00:16:37,940
Still the best-selling single truck line.

461
00:16:38,120 --> 00:16:41,242
But Chevrolet and GMC together delivered two

462
00:16:41,242 --> 00:16:43,370
hundred thirty-three thousand,

463
00:16:43,370 --> 00:16:47,130
two hundred twenty-nine Silverado and Sierra pickups.

464
00:16:47,479 --> 00:16:49,660
That is the twist that has followed

465
00:16:49,660 --> 00:16:51,218
the F-Series for decades.

466
00:16:51,398 --> 00:16:52,965
Ford counts one brand.

467
00:16:53,145 --> 00:16:56,458
General Motors sells the same basic truck

468
00:16:56,458 --> 00:16:57,832
under two brands,

469
00:16:57,832 --> 00:16:59,287
Chevrolet and GMC.

470
00:16:59,467 --> 00:17:01,148
Count them separately,

471
00:17:01,148 --> 00:17:02,218
and Ford wins.

472
00:17:02,398 --> 00:17:03,929
Count them together,

473
00:17:03,929 --> 00:17:05,536
and in some quarters,

474
00:17:05,536 --> 00:17:06,148
GM wins.

475
00:17:06,328 --> 00:17:08,431
Both sides have used the numbers that

476
00:17:08,431 --> 00:17:08,999
suit them.

477
00:17:09,179 --> 00:17:09,947
As a buyer,

478
00:17:09,947 --> 00:17:12,809
it simply means the competition is closer

479
00:17:12,809 --> 00:17:14,276
than the ads suggest.

480
00:17:14,625 --> 00:17:16,239
There is one more detail.

481
00:17:16,419 --> 00:17:19,804
The F-Series number includes the Super Duty

482
00:17:19,804 --> 00:17:23,504
heavy-duty trucks, while some rival figures are

483
00:17:23,504 --> 00:17:26,810
split between light and heavy-duty models.

484
00:17:26,990 --> 00:17:29,635
So comparing truck sales is never as

485
00:17:29,635 --> 00:17:31,913
simple as reading one headline.

486
00:17:32,093 --> 00:17:34,093
When you see a claim about who

487
00:17:34,093 --> 00:17:35,027
is number one,

488
00:17:35,027 --> 00:17:37,828
always ask which trucks are being counted.

489
00:17:38,178 --> 00:17:40,213
And there is a third player moving

490
00:17:40,213 --> 00:17:40,512
fast.

491
00:17:40,692 --> 00:17:42,144
In the same quarter,

492
00:17:42,144 --> 00:17:45,555
Ram's combined light and heavy-duty trucks rose

493
00:17:45,555 --> 00:17:47,950
thirty-three point seven percent,

494
00:17:47,950 --> 00:17:50,417
to one hundred seventeen thousand,

495
00:17:50,417 --> 00:17:52,305
seven hundred fifty-seven,

496
00:17:52,305 --> 00:17:54,264
according to autoevolution.

497
00:17:54,444 --> 00:17:56,777
Ram brought back its Hemi V eight,

498
00:17:56,777 --> 00:17:58,217
