499
00:17:58,397 --> 00:18:01,570
The full-size truck war in twenty twenty-six

500
00:18:01,570 --> 00:18:03,517
is a three-way fight again.

501
00:18:03,867 --> 00:18:06,874
Meanwhile, Ford's smaller trucks are growing.

502
00:18:07,054 --> 00:18:08,476
According to Ford,

503
00:18:08,476 --> 00:18:12,346
the Maverick sold one hundred fifty-five thousand

504
00:18:12,346 --> 00:18:15,663
and fifty-one units in twenty twenty-five,

505
00:18:15,663 --> 00:18:17,243
up eighteen percent,

506
00:18:17,243 --> 00:18:20,165
and the Ranger sold seventy thousand,

507
00:18:20,165 --> 00:18:21,666
nine hundred sixty,

508
00:18:21,666 --> 00:18:24,272
up fifty-three point six percent.

509
00:18:24,452 --> 00:18:26,531
The F-Series is still the king,

510
00:18:26,531 --> 00:18:29,079
but Ford's future growth may come from

511
00:18:29,079 --> 00:18:30,420
the trucks below it.

512
00:18:30,769 --> 00:18:32,949
So what do these five turning points

513
00:18:32,949 --> 00:18:33,858
have in common?

514
00:18:34,038 --> 00:18:36,131
Every time, Ford took a risk that

515
00:18:36,131 --> 00:18:37,590
people said would fail.

516
00:18:37,770 --> 00:18:41,404
A dedicated truck line in nineteen forty-eight.

517
00:18:41,584 --> 00:18:44,359
A new name in nineteen seventy-five.

518
00:18:44,539 --> 00:18:47,999
A round, soft design in ninety-seven.

519
00:18:48,179 --> 00:18:50,849
An aluminum body in twenty fifteen.

520
00:18:51,029 --> 00:18:53,537
An electric truck in twenty twenty-two.

521
00:18:53,717 --> 00:18:55,249
Four of those bets won.

522
00:18:55,429 --> 00:18:56,276
One did not,

523
00:18:56,276 --> 00:18:58,814
and Ford changed course within a few

524
00:18:58,814 --> 00:18:59,237
years.

525
00:18:59,587 --> 00:19:01,512
And notice the pattern in the bet

526
00:19:01,512 --> 00:19:02,211
that failed.

527
00:19:02,391 --> 00:19:05,205
The electric Lightning was the only turning

528
00:19:05,205 --> 00:19:07,692
point where Ford moved faster than its

529
00:19:07,692 --> 00:19:08,150
buyers.

530
00:19:08,330 --> 00:19:10,290
Every successful change,

531
00:19:10,290 --> 00:19:13,638
from the F-one-fifty name to the aluminum

532
00:19:13,638 --> 00:19:15,189
body to the hybrid,

533
00:19:15,189 --> 00:19:18,619
moved the truck forward while keeping what

534
00:19:18,619 --> 00:19:20,497
buyers already trusted.

535
00:19:20,677 --> 00:19:23,335
When Ford asked buyers to change too

536
00:19:23,335 --> 00:19:24,663
much, too quickly,

537
00:19:24,663 --> 00:19:25,623
they said no.

538
00:19:25,972 --> 00:19:27,993
And here is the last twist.

539
00:19:28,173 --> 00:19:30,504
The F-Series did not stay on top

540
00:19:30,504 --> 00:19:33,200
because it was always the best truck.

541
00:19:33,380 --> 00:19:34,542
In many years,

542
00:19:34,542 --> 00:19:36,700
