545
00:19:40,617 --> 00:19:42,558
the biggest dealer network,

546
00:19:42,558 --> 00:19:44,427
and a name buyers trusted.

547
00:19:44,607 --> 00:19:46,826
That trust is worth more than any

548
00:19:46,826 --> 00:19:47,834
single feature.

549
00:19:48,184 --> 00:19:50,911
One more detail shows how deep the

550
00:19:50,911 --> 00:19:53,397
F-Series runs in American life.

551
00:19:53,577 --> 00:19:56,998
Many fleets, from utility companies to city

552
