553
00:20:00,577 --> 00:20:03,759
parts, training and repairs stay simple.

554
00:20:03,939 --> 00:20:06,391
Once a fleet chooses the F-Series,

555
00:20:06,391 --> 00:20:09,059
it often keeps buying it for decades.

556
00:20:09,239 --> 00:20:11,632
That fleet loyalty is a quiet engine

557
00:20:11,632 --> 00:20:13,892
behind the forty-nine year streak,

558
00:20:13,892 --> 00:20:15,819
and it rarely shows up in the

559
00:20:15,819 --> 00:20:16,484
headlines.

560
00:20:16,833 --> 00:20:18,721
So what does this history mean if

561
00:20:18,721 --> 00:20:20,438
you are buying a Ford truck in

562
00:20:20,438 --> 00:20:21,582
twenty twenty-seven?

563
00:20:21,762 --> 00:20:24,142
